        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ashoohooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean suh ng'asheega Musa gil, argweaksiina buuneeda sean bea Israeli aba giigheawda eenda Yordani was jeeda dareapcheeda, mida Araba neekeewa Sufu, bugusta Barani, ea Dofeli ea Labani ea Haseroti ea Disahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gaba eawooji damwanagi beata sing'eada Horebu, bea naweeda lah giijeeda Seiri ea ghwahita Gadesh-barneya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweaydeaba haradam, eaweeda madeeda bea sheedeaba damanagi, goorgweaksa Musa fuga Israeli, hean ng'asheega sean rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA jea ghoah digheanyeeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata nea ning'uchi Sihoneeda was sugoocheanda Amori ahaaghwa mujiineeda Heshboni, ea Ogu was sugoocheanda Bashani, ahaaghwa Ashtaroti ea Edreyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "giigheawda eenda Yordani, jeeda ng'eanyiida Moabu, Musa ghang'eat goorgweaja iita deaweeda, nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA goobalooleasa aba Horebu, ‘Noopiidi hiji ea giijeeniin ea gageawiit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'eatng'eada ak gooweayi bareanyeekeagwa, ak gooweayi ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea fuga Amori ea heeda fuga sean ascheayi neekeewa Araba ng'eanyiida heayeeniga ea ng'eanyiida doabiiw, ea Negebu, ea madeeda basooda, ea ng'eanyiida Ganaani, ea Lebanoni, ea gwariiksa eenda haw, eenda Furati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula naayiinyi ng'eanyiida madeedeang'wa; aweayeena jeeda ak goombali ng'eanyiida aksa NG'UTAMIIDA habeawooda ghweanigeagwa, was Abrahamu, ea Isaka, ea Yakobo, jea ghoadaw saawa ea jeacheenga nyaawa iing'ata saawa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa ghwaloat fuga laja girgweaguutka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghayi aba damandida geayeeshiineegwa, ‘Aniini mwammuusi daahaaghwaneegwa nea gabwageaw; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA niihaadeagwa, ak goong'ulayi ghamneawa noowuurjeewi miinga mida humng'eeda aba seang'ayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweanigeagwa, danung' ghoahaadeagwa niba sagalama, ea anaawana gidoodeeneawi, ak gagooneegwa ghawooda ak ghoah gida ghayi heeleesiindaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydaamuustaan aniini nea gabwageaw durumanata sareendeang'wa ea giiniikghteang'wa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aghwala fuga weaghoodi bareahi iheeni, was fuga mureeda, aba jeeda gilinyoo ea dooshta gil, ak gaydanung' ghoah fuga jea ghoahaaghwaneegwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooyeeshiinean ‘gida irukuneasa ghwadoabiiw.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geagwalu fuga jea ghoahaaghwa buuneeda aba jeeda gilinyoo ea dooshingeagwa, weaghoodi bareahi iheeni, fuga mideawa mureeda, ghaanung' ghoah fuga jea ghoahaaghwaneegwa, shirikarajeega fuga was sagalamnyoojiga ea shirikarajeega fuga was bughalajeega, ea shirikarajeega fuga was haradam ea damanamughuush, shirikarajeega fuga was damanamughuush ea fuga suurja jea gang'ula dooshingeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geabaloolji fuga laja girgweaguutkeagwa aba damandida, ak geayeeshi, ‘Ooleeysiina iit ng'asheega fugeagwa, ak ghoalaji aba doobiiwnata girgweageeda siida ea orjeeda ghwaan eara rabasta mideawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoashiichi buuneeda aba lajita girgweaguutka; ooleeysiina iita fuga manang'i ea gea hees aba gilagi; adiidu eara siyagi ghoabealeagwa, aba gideaba girgweaksiinda gaba ASEETA; aba girgweageeda ooraanyi alaja gooyeanean, ak abeeda gaydealeeysa iit aniini.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gearukuneegwa aba damandida ng'asheega sean jea asina agooga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga gheang'da geecheakteawa Gadesh-barneya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean geang'eadi Horebu ak geang'eachi beata, ak geesikchi bugusta dareapcheeda haw abeal fih oadaayi; mida jeeda naweeda weah ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea fuga Amori, ak gawuurji gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA; hean geehiti Gadesh-barneya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geayeeshiineegwa agooga, ‘noohiti ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea fuga Amori, ghayi gooneasa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA niyiini ng'eanyiida madeedeang'wa, asi ng'eada ak giimbali ghoah gidarukuneata NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweanigeagwa, adiidu ghoabeali aba gurooruunatkeagwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea daba siisi neekiisean nea gooyeenyi, ‘Eecheakta gheareemanga jea goosheeda, ghwanyas iita ng'eanyiida, ak gweadu iita naweeda jea eesiga ea mujiinajeega hees jea eeweaya jeeda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanung' ng'asheanji dahoosan muuchi ak gageanu fih damaniyeenya, siyagi aba jeemba dwoash; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghwayam geat, ak gwadiyeesa ng'eanyiida heayeeniga, hean ea ghwahita moangoachi heeda Eshkoli ak ghaghwalda ghaang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaada geadi haghweegeaba ng'eanyiita ak gweaneasa, ak gweaneasa iita gicha, ak gwayi, ‘Aamiy ng'eanyiida gooneasa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ghoaheawi aweayeena hoowa, ng'ata ak goofooli diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghoaniikghchi aba jeesinga maheemajeegeagwa nea gooyeenyi, ‘nih gweagu gideaba ghwasteasa NG'UTAMIIDA, hean gooruunaneasa jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri, ak ghwayiineasa geatinga fuga Amori, gahuuydaneasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada heeda jea eegala ea eenu gil? Nea fuga siicheakti ea ninung' ghang'udeasa muuwda aba gideaba gwayi, “Fugiga ea hees nea ghabwada ea hees uurjeeni ea ghang'aleasa nea eara mujiinajeega ea hees nea geadaah ea gagul humng'eeda, ng'ata ea sidaayi orjooga Anaki aba hoowa.”’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geayeeshiineegwa, ‘Fiisu adiidu ghoabealeagwa ghana ghwanung' ahirbabana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, asheedeayeeweegwa niny gaygang'uchi aba badahuukeagwa gawuurji gidaghayi sin aba Misri nea goong'ulayi aba gheanyangeagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea aba jeeda dareapcheeda, ea noadaayi gida weataneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA nea gawuurji siida weat jeaptaanyi, aba jeeda naweeda sean oosikchi ea apkaana ng'eang'i.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghamneawa aba ng'asheesu ea meamwasa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was dea asheedeawaneegwa, ak ghoahiimneegwa heeda jea oongoorsiina maheemajeegeagwa, ak eawa ghoadoabiiweagwa aba beasta, ghoahiimu naweeda jea ayaada, nea askweari ghoadoabiiweagwa aba shamooghooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA ghwaaga ghoorjooda fuga Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghwayiiy NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheegeagwa, ak ghwanyareas, ak ghwaak habeawooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Manda eara siyagi aba jeedeaba seaygeani munyasiin jea ghwadaah ng'eanyiida miy eayeaksi habeawooda gideaba gaydaadaw ghweanigeagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geaghus Galebu orjeeda Yefune, niny gaygawa jeeda, ak gaydaadaw niny ea diibigaaschi ng'eanyiida niila aba gideaba ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA mureeda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwanyareeksean NG'UTAMIIDA aba giidiinyeanyeekeagwa, ak gwayi, ‘eara ang'iing'i majuna jeedeaba ng'eanyiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa orjeeda Nuni, was weedaneadaang'u niny gayghoahiita; adawa uurda, niny siida jea ghoadoabiiw fuga Israeli ea gwahearan ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu diibiga giyeang'wa manang'i ooyeenyi gayghoah giing'oonyanga, ea diibigeagwa, gea ghamneawa mwanala gida miiy ea dea muy gayghwahita hoowa, ak gaydaadaw saawa, ak gaygoombal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama agooga, ayamwa geat, ak gooweayi jeeda dareapcheeda aba naweeda basooda Shaamu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean gooyeenyi, ‘Sisissi riing'eeda NG'UTAMIIDA; nea gajeeweaya eeng'ucheena, gawuurji gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA.’ Ak gaba siisi sar dabitaanyi bea ng'ucheeda, ak ghoalamwaji ak gooweayi ng'eanyiida heayeeniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Eeshiina, adiidu gooweayi ak goong'uchi, aba gideaba aniini meandani jeedeang'wa; adiidu ghwajoareagwa weajoodigeagwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geabalooleegwa ak ea mooleeysiina iit, hean ghoaheawi diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, hean goosinyi ghwarjeeda ak gooweayi ng'eanyiida heayeeniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Amori abeeda abiita uhuudeaba ng'eanyiita bea heayeenigean, ghapka ak ghahoandaneegwa fuga hoan uudiga, ak ghoararang'daawaneegwa Seiri ea ahita Horma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu goobiigu ak gooyeawdi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ak NG'UTAMIIDA ea mooleeysiina iit shookeagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gweanyeeka aba jeeda eeshtearajeanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
